<entry>
    <title>秋の運動会～お弁当～</title>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/2024/1014_100000.html" />
    <id>tag:www.supercourt.jp,2024:/blog/suitayamate//10.18099</id>

    <published>2024-10-14T01:00:00Z</published>
    <updated>2024-10-14T01:00:02Z</updated>

    <summary>皆様こんにちは！神無月祭は、今年も運動会を行いました(*^^*) 運動会といえば...</summary>
    <author>
        <name>吹田山手</name>
        
    </author>
    
    
    <content type="html" xml:lang="ja" xml:base="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/">
        <![CDATA[<p>皆様こんにちは！神無月祭は、今年も運動会を行いました(*^^*)</p>
<p>運動会といえば<span style="background-color: #ffffff; color: #ff6600;"><strong>お弁当</strong></span>という事で、サンドイッチのお弁当を用意しました！</p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0575.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0575.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/10/IMG_0575-thumb-500xauto-223026.jpg" width="500" height="353" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>おしゃれな入れ物に、具沢山のサンドイッチ、ポテトサラダ、ナポリタン、エビフライ、ハンバーグ...</p>
<p>見ているだけでお腹が空いてきますね( *´艸｀)</p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0620.JPG"><img alt="IMG_0620.JPG" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/10/IMG_0620-thumb-500xauto-223035.jpg" width="500" height="483" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0586.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0586.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/10/IMG_0586-thumb-500xauto-223034.jpg" width="500" height="432" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0588.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0588.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/10/IMG_0588-thumb-500xauto-223033.jpg" width="500" height="354" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0618.JPG"><img alt="IMG_0618.JPG" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/10/IMG_0618-thumb-500xauto-223032.jpg" width="500" height="429" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0584.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0584.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/10/IMG_0584-thumb-500xauto-223031.jpg" width="500" height="401" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0583.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0583.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/10/IMG_0583-thumb-500xauto-223030.jpg" width="500" height="474" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0580.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0580.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/10/IMG_0580-thumb-500xauto-223029.jpg" width="500" height="381" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0576.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0576.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/10/IMG_0576-thumb-500xauto-223028.jpg" width="500" height="423" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>とても好評で美味しいと喜んで頂けましたヾ(≧▽≦)ﾉ</p>
<p>しっかり食べて体力を付けた後は、運動会本番です！お楽しみに！</p>]]>
        
    </content>
</entry>

