    </author>
    
    
    <content type="html" xml:lang="ja" xml:base="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/">
        <![CDATA[<p>皆様こんにちは！９月の月祭では「アイスクリーム」を作りましたヾ(≧▽≦)ﾉ</p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0005.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0005.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0005-thumb-500xauto-215729.jpg" width="500" height="368" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>厨房の方にアイスクリームを作る機械をお借りしました！</p>
<p>今回の味は【バニラ】【チョコレート】【抹茶】【さつまいも】【紅いも】の５種類です！</p>
<p>中でも【さつまいも】と【紅いも】は秋限定フレーバーです(^_-)-☆</p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/21eea3dd08cc0669de51ea0a494a9577028ecbd9.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0009.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/21eea3dd08cc0669de51ea0a494a9577028ecbd9-thumb-500xauto-215795.jpg" width="500" height="360" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/54c17d0f6f14aa331f101fd9f3579d331a3b6b2e.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0010.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/54c17d0f6f14aa331f101fd9f3579d331a3b6b2e-thumb-500xauto-215794.jpg" width="500" height="320" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>ご入居者に味を選んで頂き、職員がアイスを巻きます(^^♪</p>
<p>ご自身でアイスを巻かれる方もいらっしゃいました！</p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/09113d7674086e39f65c2d36d615f3b969dc1495.PNG"><img alt="IMG_7105.PNG" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/09113d7674086e39f65c2d36d615f3b969dc1495-thumb-500xauto-215783.png" width="500" height="375" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/30c899cc7dcc45a0e388886eed71c9d39243b0ae.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0093.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/30c899cc7dcc45a0e388886eed71c9d39243b0ae-thumb-500xauto-215782.jpg" width="500" height="304" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/6ef7ef6c6a3a80e2b75ebf1038d051687ff540b3.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0011.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/6ef7ef6c6a3a80e2b75ebf1038d051687ff540b3-thumb-500xauto-215781.jpg" width="500" height="370" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>お次はトッピングコーナー( *´艸｀)</p>
<p>機械でアイスを巻いた後は、ここで好きなものをトッピングします！</p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0006.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0006.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0006-thumb-500xauto-215741.jpg" width="500" height="374" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0007.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0007.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0007-thumb-500xauto-215740.jpg" width="500" height="362" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>お菓子にシロップ、果物など盛りだくさんで何にしようか迷います( ﾟДﾟ)</p>
<p></p>
<p>一番人気の味は【抹茶】でした！</p>
<p>皆様、和風の味が好みですね(*^^*)</p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0085.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0085.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0085-thumb-500xauto-215770.jpg" width="500" height="446" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0080.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0080.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0080-thumb-500xauto-215769.jpg" width="500" height="465" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0018.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0018.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0018-thumb-500xauto-215768.jpg" width="500" height="416" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0089.JPG"><img alt="IMG_0089.JPG" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0089-thumb-500xauto-215767.jpg" width="500" height="347" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0081.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0081.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0081-thumb-500xauto-215766.jpg" width="500" height="405" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0092.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0092.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0092-thumb-500xauto-215764.jpg" width="500" height="381" class="mt-image-none" /></a><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/IMG_0086.jpg"><img alt="IMG_0086.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/suitayamate/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0086-thumb-500xauto-215761.jpg" width="500" height="440" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>皆様、美味しそうに召し上がっておられました( *´艸｀)</p>
<p></p>
<p><iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/skkMpDaPk14?si=kPbacSewhXd7kl_8" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></p>
<p></p>
<p>来月の月祭もお楽しみに！</p>]]>
        
    </content>
